genealogische Literatur\">DigiBib</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://des.genealogy.net\" title=\"Daten-Eingabe-System\">DES</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://wiki.genealogy.net/Kategorie:Genealogiesoftware\" title=\"Software für Genealogen\">Software</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://wiki.genealogy.net/Genealogische_Mailinglisten/Discourse\" title=\"Austausch mit anderen Forschern bei genealogy.net\">Kommunikation</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://forum.genealogy.net\" title=\"Das genealogische Forum\">Forum</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://wiki.genealogy.net/Portal:Vereine\" title=\"Übersicht genealogischer Vereine im deutschsprachigen Raum\">Vereine</a></li>\n<li class=\"home-tab\"><a href=\"https://wiki.genealogy.net/Portal:Praktische_Hilfe\" title=\"Praktische Hilfen für die genealogische Forschung mit und ohne Internet\">Hilfen/FAQs</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul id=\"menue-subrow\">\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://gedbas.genealogy.net\" title=\"Genealogische Datenbasis - gesammelte Personendaten\">GEDBAS</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab-active\"><a href=\"https://gov.genealogy.net/?lang=de\" title=\"Das Geschichtliche Ortsverzeichnis - die Datenbank historischer und aktueller Ortsdaten\">GOV</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://ofb.genealogy.net\" title=\"Ortsfamilienbücher online\">OFBs</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://adressbuecher.genealogy.net\" title=\"Adressbuch-Datenbank\">Adressbücher</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://familienanzeigen.genealogy.net/\" title=\"Die Datenbank abgeschriebener veröffentlichter Familienanzeigen\">Familienanzeigen</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://grabsteine.genealogy.net/\" title=\"Grabstein-Datenbank\">Grabsteine</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"http://www.verlustlisten.de\" title=\"Erfassungsprojekt Verlustlisten des Ersten Weltkriegs\">Verlustlisten 1. WK</a></li>\n<li class=\"db-tab\"><a href=\"https://meta.genealogy.net\" title=\"Projektübergreifende Suche nach Personen (Name, Lebensorte)\">Metasuche</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/bootstrap/5.3.8/js/bootstrap.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/datatables/2.3.8/js/dataTables.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/datatables/2.3.8/js/dataTables.bootstrap5.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/leaflet/1.8.0/leaflet.js\"></script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/webjars/leaflet-markercluster/1.4.1/leaflet.markercluster.js\"></script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/js/dataTables.scroller.min.js\"></script>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n    var markers = {};\n\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"OCTNELIN99HN\" ] = L.marker( \"49.543,-1.35303\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"OCTLLEIN99EP\" ] = L.marker( \"49.6261,-1.64349\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"object_916708\" ] = L.marker( \"49.543,-1.35303\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"object_916698\" ] = L.marker( \"49.6339375,-1.6289425\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"object_905374\" ] = L.marker( \"49.5617,0.117695\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n    markers[ \"OCTMERJN09BN\" ] = L.marker( \"49.555,0.1166\".split(',') );\n    \n    \n</script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" >\n    var dataTable;\n\n    $(document).ready(function() {\n        function onMarkerMouseover(e) {\n            $(\"#\"+e.target.options.govID).addClass('info');\n            e.target.setIcon(redIcon);\n        }\n\n        function onMarkerMouseout(e) {\n            $(\"#\"+e.target.options.govID).removeClass('info');\n            e.target.setIcon(blueIcon);\n        }\n\n        function onMarkerClick(e) {\n            var row = dataTable.row(\"#\"+e.target.options.govID);\n            row.scrollTo();\n        }\n\n        var map = L.map('map');\n        L.tileLayer('https://osm.genealogy.net/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n            maxZoom: 18,\n            attribution: 'Map data &copy; <a href=\"https://openstreetmap.org\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/\">CC-BY-SA</a>'}).addTo(map);\n\n        //Extend the Default marker class\n        L.Icon.Default.imagePath = '/images/leaflet/';\n        var RedIcon = L.Icon.Default.extend({ options: { iconUrl: 'marker-icon-red.png' } });\n        var redIcon = new RedIcon();\n        var GrayIcon = L.Icon.Default.extend({ options: { iconUrl: 'marker-icon-gray.png' } });\n        var grayIcon = new GrayIcon();\n        var blueIcon = new L.Icon.Default();\n\n        var markerClusters = L.markerClusterGroup();\n        var index = 0;\n        for( var id in markers ) {\n            markers[id].options.govID = id;\n            markers[id].options.index = index;\n            markers[id].setIcon(blueIcon);\n            markers[id].on('mouseover', onMarkerMouseover).on('mouseout', onMarkerMouseout).on('click',onMarkerClick);\n            markerClusters.addLayer( markers[id] );\n            markers[id].bindPopup($(\"#\"+id+\" td:first\").next().text()); // read the popup text from the second td element of the table line with the matching id\n            index++;\n        }\n\n        map.addLayer( markerClusters );\n        map.fitBounds([ [ 49.543, -1.64349 ],  [ 49.6339375, 0.117695 ] ]);\n        if( map.getZoom() > 12 ) {\n            map.setZoom(12);\n        }\n\n        $(\"#resultlist tbody tr\").mouseover(function() {\n            $(this).addClass('info');\n            if( markers[this.id])\n                markers[this.id].setIcon(redIcon);\n        }).mouseout(function() {\n            $(this).removeClass('info');\n            if( markers[this.id])\n                markers[this.id].setIcon(blueIcon);\n        });\n\n        dataTable = $('#resultlist').DataTable({\n            \"aaSorting\": [ [ 1, \"asc\" ] ],\n            \"scrollY\":        \"400px\",\n            \"scrollCollapse\": true,\n            \"scroller\": true,\n            \"bLengthChange\": false,\n            \"bFilter\": true,\n            \"bSort\": true,\n            \"bInfo\": false,\n            \"bAutoWidth\": true,\n            \"asStripClasses\":[],\n            \"oLanguage\": {\n                \"sSearch\": \"Ergebnisfilter:\",\n                \"sZeroRecords\": \"Keine passenden Einträge gefunden.\"\n            }\n        });\n    } );\n</script>\n\n\n<!-- Matomo -->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n    var _paq = window._paq || [];\n    /* tracker methods like \"setCustomDimension\" should be called before \"trackPageView\" */\n    _paq.push(['trackPageView']);\n    _paq.push(['enableLinkTracking']);\n    (function() {\n        var u=\"//matomo.genealogy.net/\";\n        _paq.push(['setTrackerUrl', u+'matomo.php']);\n        _paq.push(['setSiteId', '3']);\n        var d=document, g=d.createElement('script'), s=d.getElementsByTagName('script')[0];\n        g.type='text/javascript'; g.async=true; g.defer=true; g.src=u+'matomo.js'; s.parentNode.insertBefore(g,s);\n    })();\n</script>\n<noscript><p><img src=\"//matomo.genealogy.net/matomo.php?idsite=3&amp;rec=1\" style=\"border:0;\" alt=\"\" /></p></noscript>\n<!-- End Matomo Code -->\n</body>\n</html>\n"
